  "notes": [
    "Joining_Type and Joining_Group are Unicode properties. visual_family and dot_pattern are provisional visual metadata and are not normative Unicode properties.",
    "forms_supported_by_joining_type describes structurally possible contextual forms only; the actual form label must come from a shaping engine for the exact context.",
    "This starter registry covers the basic Arabic alphabet plus two common extensions. It is not full Arabic-script coverage: Persian, Urdu, Quranic marks, ligatures, presentation forms, and extended Arabic blocks require separate versioned records.",
    "No MX-Font component/decomposition labels are provided. Never treat visual_family as a verified component decomposition."
  ]
